    {
      "name": "razor_storm_surge",
      "id": 1224,
      "name_zh": "风暴涌动",
      "name_en": "Storm Surge",
      "description_zh": "被攻击时拥有几率、每次受到指向性技能时都会释放一道叉状闪电，击中目标和附近其他敌人，优先打击与目标类型相同的单位，造成伤害并减缓移动速度。",
      "description_en": "There's a chance when attacked, and always when targeted with a spell, to release a forked lightning that strikes the target and other nearby enemies, prioritizing the unit type of the attacker, dealing damage and slowing movement speed.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "这个技能造成的伤害被视为反弹伤害。反弹伤害不提供任何吸血，而且无法反弹。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "Damage done by this ability is considered reflected damage. Reflected damage does not provide any lifesteal and cannot be reflected."
      ],
      "source_collection": "abilities",
      "source_pointer": "/result/data/heroes/0/abilities/2",
      "innate": false,
      "granted_by_scepter": false,
      "granted_by_shard": false,
      "upgrade_text": {
        "scepter_loc": {
          "en": "",
          "zh": ""
        },
        "shard_loc": {
          "en": "While Eye of the Storm is active, strike chance is %eye_of_the_storm_chance_multiplier%x as high, strike cooldown is reduced by %strike_cd_reduction_during_storm%s, and Lightning strikes all enemies within Eye of the Storm's radius. Does not apply to the same enemy twice from a single instance.",
          "zh": "风暴之眼开启时，打击几率为%eye_of_the_storm_chance_multiplier%倍，打击冷却时间减少%strike_cd_reduction_during_storm%秒，而且闪电会打击风暴之眼范围内所有敌人。单次伤害不会对同个敌人施加两次。"
        }
      },
